voices/<lang>_<gender>.flac (22 files) and voices/ja_sample.flac
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Reference prompts from Resemble AI's Chatterbox multilingual demo, byte-identical
to https://storage.googleapis.com/chatterbox-demo-samples/mtl_prompts/
(as used by https://huggingface.co/spaces/ResembleAI/Chatterbox-Multilingual-TTS).
No licence is stated at the source. Copyright Resemble AI or the original speakers.

voices/library/ (221 clips, see manifest.json for engine and voice per clip)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Synthesised with each engine's built-in voices. The output inherits the model's
terms:

  kokoro-*   (62)  Kokoro-82M, Apache-2.0
  piper-*    (5)   Piper voices, MIT (engine GPL-3.0)
  qwen3-*    (18)  Qwen3-TTS, Apache-2.0
  xtts-*     (116) XTTS-v2, Coqui Public Model License — NON-COMMERCIAL
  voxtral-*  (20)  Voxtral TTS, CC-BY-NC-4.0 — NON-COMMERCIAL

Do not use the xtts-* or voxtral-* clips, or anything cloned from them, in a
commercial product.

voices/private/
---------------
Gitignored. Your own reference clips live there and never ship with the repo.

Sample audio under engines/*/samples/ was synthesised by these engines and
inherits the terms of the engine and of any reference clip it was cloned from.
